System TruckThermostat

Assumes:
  cabin_temperature is an integer signal
  door_open is a boolean signal
  setpoint is an integer signal

Constants:
  hysteresis : integer = 2
  door_alarm_cycles : integer = 2

Guarantees:
  cooling_unit : boolean
  fan : boolean
  alarm : boolean [default: false]

Initial Mode: Holding

Mode Holding:
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature exceeds (setpoint + hysteresis), shall set cooling_unit to true, set fan to true, set alarm to true, transition to Cooling.
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature is below (setpoint - hysteresis), shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to true, set alarm to true, transition to Heating.
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and (not cabin_temperature exceeds (setpoint + hysteresis)) and (not cabin_temperature is below (setpoint - hysteresis)), shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, set alarm to true, remain in current.
  When door_open is true for fewer than door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature exceeds (setpoint + hysteresis), shall set cooling_unit to true, set fan to true, transition to Cooling.
  When door_open is true for fewer than door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature is below (setpoint - hysteresis), shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to true, transition to Heating.
  Otherwise, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, remain in current.

Mode Cooling:
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature is below setpoint, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, set alarm to true, transition to Holding.
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and (not cabin_temperature is below setpoint), shall set cooling_unit to true, set fan to true, set alarm to true, remain in current.
  When door_open is true for fewer than door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature is below setpoint, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, transition to Holding.
  Otherwise, shall set cooling_unit to true, set fan to true, remain in current.

Mode Heating:
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature exceeds setpoint, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, set alarm to true, transition to Holding.
  When door_open is true for door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and (not cabin_temperature exceeds setpoint), shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to true, set alarm to true, remain in current.
  When door_open is true for fewer than door_alarm_cycles consecutive cycles and cabin_temperature exceeds setpoint, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to false, transition to Holding.
  Otherwise, shall set cooling_unit to false, set fan to true, remain in current.
